# One-time v0.4.0 release request

Target: main
Version: 0.4.0
Release workflow: .github/workflows/release.yml
Purpose: dispatch the existing Windows release build once from Chat mode

This marker has no runtime effect on Aruba policy collection, exports, or installers.
The helper workflow verifies the version and skips an already-published release.
After the release is published, remove the temporary dispatch workflow.
